{"query_id": "q01", "query": "List all tables in my local Postgres database", "category": "postgres", "steps": 1, "narrative": "The user is connected to a local Postgres database and wants the names of its tables, to get oriented before writing queries. A relevant tool returns the table names. A general SQL tool also works, but the agent must write a catalog query first. Tools that list schemas or roles, or show performance stats, do not answer the question.", "judgments": [{"server_id": "io.github.antonorlov/mcp-postgres-server", "server": "Postgres (antonorlov)", "tool_name": "list_tables", "grade": 3, "group": "list-tables", "source": "bm25 #2", "reason": "Lists all tables in a schema"}, {"server_id": "io.github.YawLabs/postgres-mcp", "server": "Postgres (YawLabs)", "tool_name": "pg_list_tables", "grade": 3, "group": "list-tables", "source": "bm25 #8", "reason": "Lists tables in a schema"}, {"server_id": "io.github.YawLabs/postgres-mcp", "server": "Postgres (YawLabs)", "tool_name": "pg_query", "grade": 2, "group": "run-sql", "source": "bm25 #3", "reason": "Works, but needs a hand-written catalog query"}, {"server_id": "io.github.YawLabs/postgres-mcp", "server": "Postgres (YawLabs)", "tool_name": "pg_readonly", "grade": 2, "group": "run-sql", "source": "bm25 #4", "reason": "Same as pg_query, read-only"}, {"server_id": "io.github.antonorlov/mcp-postgres-server", "server": "Postgres (antonorlov)", "tool_name": "query", "grade": 2, "group": "run-sql", "source": "added during judging", "reason": "Works, but needs a hand-written catalog query"}, {"server_id": "io.github.antonorlov/mcp-postgres-server", "server": "Postgres (antonorlov)", "tool_name": "list_schemas", "grade": 1, "group": null, "source": "bm25 #1", "reason": "Lists schemas, not tables"}, {"server_id": "io.github.YawLabs/postgres-mcp", "server": "Postgres (YawLabs)", "tool_name": "pg_list_schemas", "grade": 1, "group": null, "source": "added during judging", "reason": "Lists schemas, not tables"}, {"server