{"query_id": "q02", "query": "Show me the commits made on this repo yesterday", "category": "git, github", "steps": 1, "narrative": "The user wants the list of commits made yesterday in the repository they are working on (a local clone that is also on GitHub). Relevant tools list commit history and can filter by date. Tools that change history (rebase, cherry-pick, push) or show one commit or a diff are not what they asked for.", "judgments": [{"server_id": "modelcontextprotocol/servers/git", "server": "Git (reference)", "tool_name": "git_log", "grade": 3, "group": "commit-history", "source": "added during judging", "reason": "Commit log with start and end time filters"}, {"server_id": "io.github.cyanheads/git-mcp-server", "server": "Git (cyanheads)", "tool_name": "git_log", "grade": 3, "group": "commit-history", "source": "added during judging", "reason": "Commit history with since/until filters"}, {"server_id": "io.github.github/github-mcp-server", "server": "GitHub (official)", "tool_name": "list_commits", "grade": 3, "group": "commit-history", "source": "bm25 #5", "reason": "Lists commits on GitHub with since/until"}, {"server_id": "io.github.github/github-mcp-server", "server": "GitHub (official)", "tool_name": "search_commits", "grade": 2, "group": "commit-history", "source": "bm25 #6", "reason": "Date search works, but default branch only"}, {"server_id": "io.github.cyanheads/git-mcp-server", "server": "Git (cyanheads)", "tool_name": "git_show", "grade": 1, "group": null, "source": "bm25 #7", "reason": "Shows one commit; needs its ID first"}, {"server_id": "modelcontextprotocol/servers/git", "server": "Git (reference)", "tool_name": "git_diff", "grade": 1, "group": null, "source": "bm25 #9", "reason": "Shows changes, not the list of commits"}, {"server_id": "io.github.cyanheads/git-mcp-server", "server": "Git (cyanheads)", "tool_name": "git_diff", "grade": 1, "group": null, "source": "bm25 #10", "reason": "Shows changes, not the list of commits"}, {"server_id